{"name": "Astral Lords", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every drop is an overwhelming dimensional strike against the alien ecology. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this brutal sector, enforce your will with firepower and forge absolute power with fortresses.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Commander, are you ready for this interstellar baptism?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/11b3b5bac7c62aefb222b4929754c3e3.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat centers around high-speed, horde-slaying shooting, deeply integrated with unpredictable Roguelite elements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing endless waves of alien creatures, you must execute extreme dodges and unleash massive firepower in a dense jungle of bullets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/95c8df5133ecaabfb8ee56b674e7370a.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"638\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/95c8df5133ecaabfb8ee56b674e7370a.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/95c8df5133ecaabfb8ee56b674e7370a.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up through combat and make crucial choices among highly randomized skills and enhancement chips. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a unique build for every drop, turning crises into opportunities for massive power spikes, and enjoy the pure adrenaline rush of an action shooter.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"224\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/33b4404da38c024a82bf4c20c569dde1.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/33b4404da38c024a82bf4c20c569dde1.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/33b4404da38c024a82bf4c20c569dde1.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/2b275b454775de43ec62e9c99358b9e9.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ditch tedious micro-management and use \"building combos\" to define your tactical depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In the gaps between unleashing firepower, you can choose to \"turtle up,\" erecting impenetrable machine-gun towers and resource facilities to create an unbreakable defensive meat grinder.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"220\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/e6a8048ed852a9629222aa33328e9bb8.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/e6a8048ed852a9629222aa33328e9bb8.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/e6a8048ed852a9629222aa33328e9bb8.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternatively, choose to \"lead the charge\" by blanketing the map with clone barracks and assembly plants, commanding an endless steel tide to proactively crush all resistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"254\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7609c7740d1c032addd1f9348b7a4fe2.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7609c7740d1c032addd1f9348b7a4fe2.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/7609c7740d1c032addd1f9348b7a4fe2.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/ae9bc295e2ba7219ab77ce096f3fec69.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bloody battles within each run pave the way for your out-of-run glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Funnel the scarce resources plundered across various star sectors back to your headquarters to build, decorate, and upgrade your exclusive home system from scratch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"210\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/f700cafac428a89e1546ac85e9f4ef36.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/f700cafac428a89e1546ac85e9f4ef36.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/f700cafac428a89e1546ac85e9f4ef36.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This interstellar territory, personally planned by you, is not just a showroom for your spoils, but the core hub for unlocking new tech trees, powerful units, and advanced buildings, allowing your arsenal to expand continuously with your conquests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/cf96b9f95d0906a1c4dd50b717625cc3.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/cf96b9f95d0906a1c4dd50b717625cc3.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/cf96b9f95d0906a1c4dd50b717625cc3.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"322\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/0b44a83dfac06c364ff0bf757e5fe3f3.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"636\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/0b44a83dfac06c364ff0bf757e5fe3f3.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/0b44a83dfac06c364ff0bf757e5fe3f3.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/204852a5c8d140c0a26a4740cfaa6a79.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This time, put down the hero script of saving the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an operative appointed by the Interstellar Empire, your mission is cold and pure: execute the Great Colonial Star Plan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"304\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/860f8152face6e41892dee840a719110.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/860f8152face6e41892dee840a719110.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/860f8152face6e41892dee840a719110.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Facing diverse alien ecologies, cast aside all moral constraints. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have only two choices\u2014physical annihilation via absolute firepower, or iron-fisted rule via imposing fortresses. Embrace your role as the \"Fourth Scourge,\" and enjoy a cosmic rampage belonging only to the ultimate conqueror.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"376\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/287554c017e385095b7d5608b3e0032a.poster.avif?t=1784699551\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/287554c017e385095b7d5608b3e0032a.webm?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/extras/287554c017e385095b7d5608b3e0032a.mp4?t=1784699551\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Shatter genre boundaries in this sci-fi survival Roguelite blending bullet-hell action and base-building RTS. Dodge and unleash screen-clearing firepower against alien hordes, while constructing fortresses and real-time automated defenses to crush your enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324250/312e4443c93c69a6b181cc7dfb8815403c8bf33a/header.jpg?t=1784699551", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Action Roguelike", "Action", "Military", "Base Building", "Crafting"], "developers": "Dark Dimension", "publishers": "Dark Dimension", "release_date": "Jun 5, 2026", "price": "$12.99", "appid": "3324250", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/g639nW85CDM", "first_seen": 1770591600.0, "review_rank": 1241}